    "interpretation": "Detection recall and FDI accuracy are measured on DENTEX disease/ (164 leak-free images, RESULTS_LOG 2026-08-22j). A missed tooth is absent from this report; a misnumbered tooth carries correct findings under the wrong FDI code. Expect roughly half the codes in this report to be wrong.",
